      "content": "hey, i'm working on a project for my psych class about how different urban environments affect social behavior. i want to design a personality assessment that helps identify people who might have grown up in high-risk or high-stress neighborhood settings. can you help me come up with some behavioral indicators or question types that would help distinguish someone from those types of backgrounds? like, what kind of personality traits or communication styles are more common in those areas?",
